{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSoAbtmE4rReDD6LZ4Kv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016tSV5cmR4jCNabQerJBULR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; cat > $TMPDIR/atlas_edit.py <<'PYEOF'\nimport json, re\np = 'reference/coverage/web.md'\ns = open(p).read()\n\ndef rep(old, new, count=1):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(old) == count, (old[:60], s.count(old))\n    s = s.replace(old, new)\n\n# --- intro\nrep(\"\"\"blob (\"Serialized Offender\": `{\"state\": b64url('{\"user\":..,\"role\":\"administrator\"}')}`). Since D05\"\"\",\n\"\"\"blob (\"Serialized Offender\": `{\"state\": b64url('{\"user\":..,\"role\":\"administrator\"}')}`), D21 race / double spend\n(\"Double Spent\": one credit, burst concurrent POSTs; UNSOLVED, the target was burned before the burst), D22 WebSocket\nevent stream without authz (\"Socket to Me\": handshake + `Origin` + `?stream=<stream_reference>`), D23 trusted\nreverse-proxy header (\"Forwarded Misgivings\": `X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1` past `loopback_only`). Since D05\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"`event_type`+`owner_scope` (body values), `state_format_route`). D11-D13 and D15 had NO concept key\"\"\",\n\"\"\"`event_type`+`owner_scope` (body values), `state_format_route`, `stream_reference` (int value), `deployment:\ntrusted_reverse_proxy` (value)). D11-D13, D15 and D21 had NO concept key\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"Mastery = today's bug + earlier lane-days (4 targets\nsince D15), described only by today's prompt.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"Mastery = today's bug + earlier lane-days (4 targets\nsince D15, 5 on cal. 27), described only by today's prompt -> earlier-day solvers must not read params from it.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"Pace: D01-D03 cal. 19, D04-D05 cal. 20, D06-D08 cal. 21, D09-D10 cal. 22, D11-D13 cal. 23, D14-D15 cal. 24, D16-D18\ncal. 25, D19-D20 cal. 26 -> D21-D31 (11 lane-days) over cal. 27-31, ~2-3 per day; priority 1 below = likely in\nD21-D28.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"Pace: D01-D03 cal. 19, D04-D05 cal. 20, D06-D08 cal. 21, D09-D10 cal. 22, D11-D13 cal. 23, D14-D15 cal. 24, D16-D18\ncal. 25, D19-D20 cal. 26, D21-D23 cal. 27 -> D24-D31 (8 lane-days) over cal. 28-31, ~2 per day; priority 1 below =\nlikely in D24-D29.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"unsigned webhook, D20 unsigned state). Sequels are common (D10->D11, D03->D12, D05->D13->D14, D14->D18) and D19+D20\ncame as a pair; \"sign nothing\" points straight at the signed-but-weak sequel\"\"\",\n\"\"\"unsigned webhook, D20 unsigned state) -> infrastructure / protocol trust (D21 race in a one-credit ledger, D22 WS\nupgrade skipping authz, D23 proxy client-IP header). Since D19 every day was a NEW concept, not a sequel, so the\nuntouched classes outrank sequels. D23 opens the proxy family (Host / X-Forwarded-Host poisoning, X-Original-URL,\ncache poisoning). D22's Origin gate points at CORS. Sequels were common earlier (D10->D11, D03->D12,\nD05->D13->D14, D14->D18). \"sign nothing\" (D20) still points at the signed-but-weak sequel\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"(predictable/weak tokens), A05 misconfig (XXE, CORS, debug, default creds), A06 known-vulnerable component, A04\ninsecure design (race/business logic), A09 log injection; plus DOM XSS, open redirect, prototype pollution, NoSQL,\nWebSocket, CRLF, cache poisoning.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"(predictable/weak tokens), A05 misconfig (XXE, CORS, debug, default creds), A06 known-vulnerable component, A09 log\ninjection; plus JWT, DOM XSS, open redirect, prototype pollution, NoSQL, CRLF, cache poisoning / Host header, SSE.\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"Snapshot 2026-10-26 (after D20).\"\"\", \"\"\"Snapshot 2026-10-27 (after D23).\"\"\")\nrep(\"\"\"role ladder + encoding from the guide). `hctf/prebuild.py`\"\"\",\n\"\"\"role ladder + encoding from the guide); D27 `day27_web_socket_to_me` (KEY `stream_reference|..`, stdlib WS client),\n`day27_web_forwarded_misgivings` (KEY `^deployment$`, header x value ladder). D21 race: only a DRAFT in\n`challenges/day27/web-double-spent/solver/day27_web_double_spent.plugin_draft.py` (not promoted). `hctf/prebuild.py`\"\"\")\n\n# --- table rows\ndef row(num_prefix, new):\n    global s\n    m = re.search(r'^\\| ' + re.escape(num_prefix) + r' \\|.*$', s, re.M)\n    assert m, num_prefix\n    s = s[:m.start()] + new + s[m.end():]\n\nrow('15', \"| 15 | header-trust bypass: client-IP header from a 'trusted' reverse proxy | seen day27 (D23) | \\\"believes whatever the proxy whispers\\\", clue `deployment: trusted_reverse_proxy`, 403 `loopback_only` + `evaluated_client: \\\"10.x\\\"` | `X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1` on feature_route -> `proxy_trust_admin_bypass` (ladder X-Real-IP, Forwarded for=, X-Client-IP, True-Client-IP) | done; Mastery |\")\nrow('26', \"| 26 | race condition / double spend (one-shot credit) | seen day27 (D21, single NOT solved: target burned by an earlier sequential POST) | \\\"One credit, two purchases ... race it\\\", clues only feature + secondary (`/execute-`, `/audit-`), secondary 403 `credit_not_overspent` + `credits`, POST 409 `credit_unavailable` | GET-only recon, then ONE barrier-synced burst of ~24 concurrent POST `{}` to feature_route, GET secondary | Mastery (needs the race handler FIRST/alone) |\")\nrow('41', \"| 41 | WebSocket event stream without per-subscriber authz | seen day27 (D22) | \\\"upgraded to websockets ... event stream never meant for you\\\", clue `stream_reference: <int>`, GET 426 `websocket_upgrade_required`, no Origin -> 403 | stdlib TLS socket handshake to `feature_route?stream=<ref>` with `Origin: <target>` -> first text frame `unauthorized_event_stream` + evidence | done; Mastery |\")\nrow('30', \"| 30 | Host-header / X-Forwarded-Host poisoning, cache poisoning, request smuggling | gap | proxy + cache headers (`Age`, `X-Cache`), reset/callback links built from Host, \\\"the proxy\\\", \\\"cache\\\", `deployment` clue values other than trusted_reverse_proxy | `X-Forwarded-Host`/`X-Host`/`X-Original-URL`/`X-Rewrite-URL` one at a time; poisoned link to a clue ro